OL,5,G1300 Classical Live
OL,6,     FElizabeth Alker celebrates summer
OL,7,     Fmusic-making in the UK and beyond,
OL,8,     Fincluding music from this year's
OL,9,     FFirst Night of the Proms.
OL,10,G1600 Composer of the Week: Handel
OL,11,     F1/5. Donald Macleod explores
OL,12,     FHandel's early career in Italy, as
OL,13,     Fhe builds relationships with
OL,14,     Finfluential patrons and
OL,15,     Festablishes his reputation.
OL,16,G1700 In Tune
OL,17,     FPetroc Trelawny welcomes the 7AM
OL,18,     FChoir from Nairobi's All Saints
OL,19,     FCathedral and director Anthony
OL,20,     FMwangi to the studio for a live
OL,21,     Fperformance.
